      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Use **Explore \u2192 Tempo** and a trace ID from an execution event to inspect HTTP \u2192 queue \u2192 worker \u2192 provider \u2192 artifact spans.\n\nTransport queue depth is unavailable because the emulator runtime-count response is incompatible with the SDK parser. Publication, consumption and redelivery rates above are measured. Counters reset with application processes. No Azure resources are used."
